    {
      "question": "After looking at 3 cards from the top of my deck, can I place 1 card on the top and 2 cards on the bottom?",
      "answer": "No, you cannot. After deciding the order in which you want to place the 3 cards, you must choose whether to return all 3 cards to the top or bottom of the deck.",
